Section: network
Priority: extra
Description: PBX3 - API-driven configurator for Asterisk
 PBX3 is a backend-only worker: Asterisk config, DB, scripts. No HTTP
 server. Target: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (Noble). Run
 /opt/pbx3/scripts/installer.sh after install. HTTP/API is provided
 by pbx3api (nginx + PHP-FPM); install pbx3api for the API.
